<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?><rss xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom" version="2.0"><channel><title>World News, Today World News, Latest International News, World Breaking News, Trending News of World - Times of India</title><link>https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world</link><description>World News Today: Read the latest world news headlines, Current International breaking news world wide. In depth analysis and top news headlines world wide.</description><language>en-gb</language><lastBuildDate>2026-04-22T07:35:43+05:30</lastBuildDate><atom:link type="application/rss+xml" rel="self" href="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/rssfeeds/296589292.cms"/><copyright>Copyright:(C) Wed, 22 Apr 2026 07:35:43 IST Bennett Coleman &amp; Co. Ltd, http://in.indiatimes.com/policyterms/1554651.cms</copyright><docs>http://syndication.indiatimes.com/</docs><image><title>World News, Today World News, Latest International News, World Breaking News, Trending News of World - Times of India</title><url>https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/507610.cms</url><link>https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world</link></image><item><title><![CDATA['Trust &amp; confidence reposed': Pak PM thanks Trump for ceasefire extension]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/130429761.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[Pakistan's Prime Minister Shehbaz Sharif thanked US President Trump for extending the Iran conflict ceasefire, hoping for lasting peace.  Sharif expressed optimism for a 'Peace Deal' in upcoming Islamabad talks, emphasizing Pakistan's continued mediation.  Despite the truce extension, uncertainty lingers due to Iran's conditional engagement and the US naval blockade, though global leaders cautiously welcome the de-escalation.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/pakistan/trust-and-confidence-reposed-pakistan-pm-shehbaz-sharif-thanks-donald-trump-for-ceasefire-extension/articleshow/130429761.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/pakistan/trust-and-confidence-reposed-pakistan-pm-shehbaz-sharif-thanks-donald-trump-for-ceasefire-extension/articleshow/130429761.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-04-22T07:02:22+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">TOI World Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-130429794,imgsize-656404.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA["I’m gonna be a dad": Clavicular sparks outrage after shocking “impregnation competition” idea goes viral]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/130429445.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[Clavicular sparked widespread backlash after proposing a controversial “impregnation competition” during a livestream. His comments quickly went viral, drawing criticism and comparisons to Bonnie Blue, known for past attention-grabbing stunts. Many online users questioned his intent, with some calling it shock content, as debates around viral culture and boundaries intensified across social media.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us-streamers/im-gonna-be-a-dad-clavicular-sparks-outrage-after-shocking-impregnation-competition-idea-goes-viral/articleshow/130429445.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us-streamers/im-gonna-be-a-dad-clavicular-sparks-outrage-after-shocking-impregnation-competition-idea-goes-viral/articleshow/130429445.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-04-22T05:46:10+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">Barsha Dutta</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-130429445,imgsize-36632.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[Who is Klaudia Glam? Influencer critical after London Soho nightclub crash, leaving three injured on Argyll Street]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/130429212.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[Klaudia Zakrzewska, known as Klaudia Glam, is in critical condition after a car crash in London’s Soho area. The accident injured three people, including a man with serious injuries. Police are investigating the incident and asking witnesses to come forward. Zakrzewska, a well-known influencer, remains under medical care as updates on her condition are awaited.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us-streamers/who-is-klaudia-glam-influencer-critical-after-london-soho-nightclub-crash-leaves-three-injured-on-argyll-street/articleshow/130429212.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us-streamers/who-is-klaudia-glam-influencer-critical-after-london-soho-nightclub-crash-leaves-three-injured-on-argyll-street/articleshow/130429212.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-04-22T03:52:51+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">Sehjal Gupta</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-130429208,imgsize-730048.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[Mooda banned from Rainbow Six Siege after beating Jynxzi as cheating claims and past truth raise questions]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/130427398.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[Ahmad “Mooda” was banned from Rainbow Six Siege after cheating claims surfaced during a match with Jynxzi. While he denied cheating and even swore on stream, older claims about his past created more doubt. PC checks later said no recent cheating was found. Mooda admitted he lied about being new, which added to the controversy.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us-streamers/mooda-banned-from-rainbow-six-siege-after-beating-jynxzi-as-cheating-claims-and-past-truth-raise-questions/articleshow/130427398.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us-streamers/mooda-banned-from-rainbow-six-siege-after-beating-jynxzi-as-cheating-claims-and-past-truth-raise-questions/articleshow/130427398.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-04-22T03:30:00+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">Sumit Roy</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-130427386,imgsize-27532.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[PaymoneyWubby and Fanfan share disbelief after viral Twitch clip gets picked by Adam Sandler for $2000]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/130427376.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[Dennis “PaymoneyWubby” Richardson and Fiona “Fanfan” Nova earned $2,000 each after their Twitch clip was used in Adam Sandler’s Roommates. The clip, taken from a casual Minecraft stream, went viral and reached the film’s team. The audio was officially licensed, showing how simple online moments can turn into real opportunities on larger platforms.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us-streamers/paymoneywubby-and-fanfan-share-disbelief-after-viral-twitch-clip-gets-picked-by-adam-sandler-for-2000/articleshow/130427376.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us-streamers/paymoneywubby-and-fanfan-share-disbelief-after-viral-twitch-clip-gets-picked-by-adam-sandler-for-2000/articleshow/130427376.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-04-22T03:00:00+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">Sumit Roy</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-130427371,imgsize-43064.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[Indian Uber driver accused of killing baby passenger after falling asleep and crashing vehicle]]></title><d